  <div id="get-beta-access-to-our-endpoints-as-soon-as-they-become-available" class="page-section-anchor"></div>

<div class="page-section-headline text-left">
                <h2 class="page-section-title"><span class="text-neon-purple">Get beta access</span> <span class="text-dark-gray">to our endpoints as soon as they become available</span></h2>
      
  </div>
                    

          
                      


<div class="page-section-body">
  <div class="text-left">
          <p>Subscribe to the Starter Medium plan or above to get exclusive access to new Moz API methods as they become available. You'll also gain access to expanded data, new method documentation, and streamlined authentication. </p><p>You will also have access to additional rows of data, <a href="/api/docs">new method documentation</a> and getting started guides, and streamlined authentication.</p>
